WEBVTT

00:07:28.676 --> 00:07:31.876
And I think the opportunity
we have here now, Whitney,

00:07:31.916 --> 00:07:33.876
is with the great resignation

00:07:33.916 --> 00:07:36.756
and the fact that there are
so many open jobs,

00:07:36.796 --> 00:07:40.596
it has become a seller's
market for employees.

00:07:41.156 --> 00:07:44.316
And so if there's ever been
a moment to say, hey,

00:07:44.356 --> 00:07:47.356
we need to start providing
childcare benefits

00:07:47.396 --> 00:07:49.556
and maybe even subsidizing
people's childcare,

00:07:49.596 --> 00:07:51.596
that's the way we actually solve it.

00:07:51.636 --> 00:07:54.996
This is an economic problem,
not a personal problem.

00:07:55.316 --> 00:07:58.396
The moment for that conversation is now.

00:07:58.396 --> 00:08:03.156
WPR: Reshma, we have a question here
from a TED Member, they ask,